{
    "title": "FourKites CarrierLink App",
    "description": "Welcome to FourKites CarrierLink- the most intuitive, hassle-free way for drivers to communicate with their freight brokerage trading partners and the Shippers. \r\n\r\nCarrierLink powered by FourKites is a free, easy to use and time saving app for truck drivers to communicate about assigned loads without having to make check-in calls. \r\nUsing the app, drivers can send automatic location updates which lets your shipper always know where the load is.\r\nAvoid all the manual check-in calls to make your driving distraction free and safer.\r\n\r\nYou can also upload documents, communicate about truck availability and access Truck Specific Turn-By-Turn Navigation with fuel cost details across various route options.  \r\nTo get started, get in touch with your brokers or call 888 466 6958 for more details. \r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n\u2022\tGet instant notification when a load is assigned to you by shippers and brokers\r\n\u2022\tSeamless automated location tracking for your assigned loads.\r\n\u2022\tFREE Truck Specific Turn-By-Turn Navigation with Voice Guidance\r\n\u2022\tDiscover Nearby Facilities, View Facility Amenities & Parking, Truck Stops on the go.\r\n\u2022\tUpload BOL, POD, Invoice, Scale Tickets and Lumper receipts to initiate the payment process\r\n\r\nFourKites - CarrierLink - Take the new road to smarter communication for logistics and supply chain!\r\n\r\nFourKites Terms of Use: http://mobile.fourkites.com/terms.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to FourKites CarrierLink- the most intuitive, hassle-free way for drivers to communicate with their freight brokerage trading partners and the Shippers. <br><br>CarrierLink powered by FourKites is a free, easy to use and time saving app for truck drivers to communicate about assigned loads without having to make check-in calls. <br>Using the app, drivers can send automatic location updates which lets your shipper always know where the load is.<br>Avoid all the manual check-in calls to make your driving distraction free and safer.<br><br>You can also upload documents, communicate about truck availability and access Truck Specific Turn-By-Turn Navigation with fuel cost details across various route options.  <br>To get started, get in touch with your brokers or call 888 466 6958 for more details. <br><br>FEATURES<br>\u2022\tGet instant notification when a load is assigned to you by shippers and brokers<br>\u2022\tSeamless automated location tracking for your assigned loads.<br>\u2022\tFREE Truck Specific Turn-By-Turn Navigation with Voice Guidance<br>\u2022\tDiscover Nearby Facilities, View Facility Amenities &amp; Parking, Truck Stops on the go.<br>\u2022\tUpload BOL, POD, Invoice, Scale Tickets and Lumper receipts to initiate the payment process<br><br>FourKites - CarrierLink - Take the new road to smarter communication for logistics and supply chain!<br><br>FourKites Terms of Use: http://mobile.fourkites.com/terms.html",
